      <title>Git基础与核心操作（下）</title>
      <link href="/2026/07/12/Git%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E4%B8%8E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8B%EF%BC%89/"/>
      <url>/2026/07/12/Git%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E4%B8%8E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8B%EF%BC%89/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<blockquote><p>本篇教程介绍 Git 的分支管理、冲突解决、常用工作流，需要具备 Git 的基础。</p><p>没有基础的可以先看<a href="https://www.yzgr.top/2026/07/07/Git%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E4%B8%8E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8A%EF%BC%89/">《Git 基础与核心操作（上）》</a><br>之后在回来观看这个教程。</p></blockquote><hr><h2 id="一、分支管理"><a href="#一、分支管理" class="headerlink" title="一、分支管理"></a>一、分支管理</h2><h3 id="什么是分支"><a href="#什么是分支" class="headerlink" title="什么是分支"></a>什么是分支</h3><p>把分支想成<strong>复印一份档案出来改</strong>，原件（main 分支）完全不动。</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">                  ┌── feature/login (你的副本)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">                 /</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">main:  A ── B ── C ── D ── E</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">                                 \</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">                                  └─── feature/payment (另一个副本)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="git-branch-—-分支操作"><a href="#git-branch-—-分支操作" class="headerlink" title="git branch — 分支操作"></a><code>git branch</code> — 分支操作</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git branch                          <span class="comment"># 查看本地分支</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git branch -a                       <span class="comment"># 查看所有分支（包括远程）</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git branch feature/login            <span class="comment"># 创建分支</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git branch -d feature/login         <span class="comment"># 删除已合并的分支</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git branch -D feature/login         <span class="comment"># 强制删除（未合并也能删）</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git branch -m old-name new-name     <span class="comment"># 重命名当前分支</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="git-checkout-git-switch-—-切换分支"><a href="#git-checkout-git-switch-—-切换分支" class="headerlink" title="git checkout &#x2F; git switch — 切换分支"></a><code>git checkout</code> &#x2F; <code>git switch</code> — 切换分支</h3><p>Git 2.23+ 推荐用 <code>git switch</code>（语义更清晰）：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git switch feature/login            <span class="comment"># 切换到 feature/login</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git switch -c feature/new-feature   <span class="comment"># 创建并切换（-c = create）</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>老式写法（仍然有效）：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git checkout feature/login</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git checkout -b feature/new-feature</span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><code>checkout</code> 还能恢复文件（不推荐，已被 <code>git restore</code> 替代）。</p><h3 id="git-merge-—-合并分支"><a href="#git-merge-—-合并分支" class="headerlink" title="git merge — 合并分支"></a><code>git merge</code> — 合并分支</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git switch main                     <span class="comment"># 先切到主分支</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git merge feature/login             <span class="comment"># 把 feature/login 合并到 main</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>两种合并方式</strong>：</p><p><strong>1. Fast-forward（快进合并）</strong></p><p>feature 分支没新提交，直接把 main 指针往前移：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">Before:  main:  A ── B</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">                   \</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">                    C ── D   feature/login</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">  </span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">After:   main:  A ── B ── C ── D</span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>2. Three-way merge（三方合并）</strong></p><p>main 和 feature 都有新提交，Git 自动创建一个合并提交：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">Before:  main:  A ── B ── E</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">                   \</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">                    C ── D   feature/login</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">  </span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">After:   main:  A ── B ── E ── M (merge commit)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">                   \         /</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">                    C ── D</span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="git-branch-d-—-删除分支"><a href="#git-branch-d-—-删除分支" class="headerlink" title="git branch -d — 删除分支"></a><code>git branch -d</code> — 删除分支</h3><p>合并完之后，分支可以删了（保留也行）：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git branch -d feature/login</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">Deleted branch feature/login (was abc1234).</span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="分支命名建议"><a href="#分支命名建议" class="headerlink" title="分支命名建议"></a>分支命名建议</h3><table><thead><tr><th>类型</th><th>前缀</th><th>例子</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>新功能</td><td><code>feature/</code></td><td><code>feature/user-login</code></td></tr><tr><td>修 bug</td><td><code>bugfix/</code> 或 <code>fix/</code></td><td><code>fix/login-error</code></td></tr><tr><td>紧急修复</td><td><code>hotfix/</code></td><td><code>hotfix/prod-crash</code></td></tr><tr><td>实验性</td><td><code>experiment/</code></td><td><code>experiment/new-ui</code></td></tr></tbody></table><hr><h2 id="二、冲突解决"><a href="#二、冲突解决" class="headerlink" title="二、冲突解决"></a>二、冲突解决</h2><h3 id="什么是冲突"><a href="#什么是冲突" class="headerlink" title="什么是冲突"></a>什么是冲突</h3><p><strong>两个人改了同一文件的同一行</strong>——Git 没法判断该听谁的，于是停下来让你拍板。</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git pull</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">Auto-merging README.md</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">CONFLICT (content): Merge conflict in README.md</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">Automatic merge failed; fix conflicts and then commit the result.</span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="冲突文件长这样"><a href="#冲突文件长这样" class="headerlink" title="冲突文件长这样"></a>冲突文件长这样</h3><p>打开冲突文件，会看到冲突标记：</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt; HEAD</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">这是我在 main 分支写的介绍</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">=======</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">这是我在 feature 分支写的介绍</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; feature/login</span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ul><li><p><code>&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt; HEAD</code> 到 <code>=======</code> 之间：<strong>当前分支</strong>（HEAD）的内容</p></li><li><p><code>=======</code> 到 <code>&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; feature/login</code> 之间：<strong>要合并进来的分支</strong>的内容</p></li></ul><h3 id="解决步骤"><a href="#解决步骤" class="headerlink" title="解决步骤"></a>解决步骤</h3><ol><li><p><strong>打开冲突文件</strong>，看清楚两边都写了啥</p></li><li><p><strong>手动决定保留什么</strong>（保留一边 &#x2F; 两边都留 &#x2F; 两边都改 &#x2F; 都不留）</p></li><li><p><strong>删除所有冲突标记</strong>（<code>&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;</code>、<code>=======</code>、<code>&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;</code>）</p></li><li><p><strong>保存文件</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>标记为已解决</strong>：</p></li></ol><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git add README.md</span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ol start="6"><li><strong>完成合并</strong>：</li></ol><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git commit</span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>Git 会自动填好合并提交信息，改一下就能用。</p><h3 id="实用技巧"><a href="#实用技巧" class="headerlink" title="实用技巧"></a>实用技巧</h3><table><thead><tr><th>命令</th><th>作用</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>git status</code></td><td>查看哪些文件冲突</td></tr><tr><td><code>git diff</code></td><td>看具体冲突内容</td></tr><tr><td><code>git merge --abort</code></td><td>放弃合并，回到合并前状态</td></tr><tr><td><code>git checkout --ours file.txt</code></td><td>冲突文件保留当前分支版本</td></tr><tr><td><code>git checkout --theirs file.txt</code></td><td>冲突文件保留对方版本</td></tr><tr><td><code>git rerere</code></td><td>记住冲突解决方案，下次自动套用</td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id="预防冲突的几个习惯"><a href="#预防冲突的几个习惯" class="headerlink" title="预防冲突的几个习惯"></a>预防冲突的几个习惯</h3><ul><li><p>**频繁 <code>git pull</code>**：开始干活前先拉最新</p></li><li><p><strong>小步提交</strong>：一次只改一件事，减少冲突面</p></li><li><p><strong>明确分工</strong>：团队约定好谁改哪个文件</p></li><li><p>**用 <code>.gitignore</code>**：避免不小心提交二进制文件、依赖、密码</p></li></ul><hr><h2 id="三、常用工作流"><a href="#三、常用工作流" class="headerlink" title="三、常用工作流"></a>三、常用工作流</h2><h3 id="个人项目（最简）"><a href="#个人项目（最简）" class="headerlink" title="个人项目（最简）"></a>个人项目（最简）</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git init</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git add .</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git commit -m <span class="string">&quot;xxx&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git remote add origin &lt;url&gt;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git push -u origin main</span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>日常：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git pull                <span class="comment"># 开始前拉最新</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 改代码</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git add .</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git commit -m <span class="string">&quot;xxx&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git push</span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="团队协作（功能分支）"><a href="#团队协作（功能分支）" class="headerlink" title="团队协作（功能分支）"></a>团队协作（功能分支）</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 1. 基于 main 拉新功能分支</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git switch main</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git pull</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git switch -c feature/new-thing</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">  </span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 2. 在功能分支上开发</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git add .</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git commit -m <span class="string">&quot;feat: add new thing&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git push -u origin feature/new-thing</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">  </span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 3. 在 GitHub/Gitee 上提 Pull Request / Merge Request</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 4. 合并后切回 main 拉最新</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git switch main</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git pull</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">  </span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 5. 删掉已合并的功能分支</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git branch -d feature/new-thing</span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>常见工作流分为 Git flow （图一）和 GitHub flow也叫 敏捷工作流（图2）</p><p>具体的内容可能要等以后出一篇详细的教程<br><img src="https://picgocloud.com/m/1e782438-dfa7-40fd-8be9-bdc87ad38974.png"><br><img src="https://picgocloud.com/m/28570142-93ce-4c5f-b9c4-d2b4a438b502.png"></p><h3 id="提交规范（Conventional-Commits）"><a href="#提交规范（Conventional-Commits）" class="headerlink" title="提交规范（Conventional Commits）"></a>提交规范（Conventional Commits）</h3><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">&lt;type&gt;(&lt;scope&gt;): &lt;subject&gt;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">  </span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">&lt;body&gt;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">  </span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">&lt;footer&gt;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>常用 type：</p><table><thead><tr><th>type</th><th>含义</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>feat</code></td><td>新功能</td></tr><tr><td><code>fix</code></td><td>修 bug</td></tr><tr><td><code>docs</code></td><td>文档改动</td></tr><tr><td><code>style</code></td><td>格式（不影响代码运行）</td></tr><tr><td><code>refactor</code></td><td>重构（既不是新功能也不是修 bug）</td></tr><tr><td><code>test</code></td><td>加测试</td></tr><tr><td><code>chore</code></td><td>构建 &#x2F; 工具 &#x2F; 杂项</td></tr></tbody></table><p>例子：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">feat(login): add OAuth2 support</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">  </span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">- Add Google OAuth2 login flow</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">- Update User model with provider field</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">- Add tests for new login method</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">  </span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">Closes #123</span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="四、救命命令"><a href="#四、救命命令" class="headerlink" title="四、救命命令"></a>四、救命命令</h2><table><thead><tr><th>场景</th><th>命令</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>撤销 <code>git add</code>（文件还在）</td><td><code>git restore --staged &lt;file&gt;</code></td></tr><tr><td>撤销工作区修改（危险，不可恢复）</td><td><code>git restore &lt;file&gt;</code></td></tr><tr><td>修改上一次 commit message</td><td><code>git commit --amend</code></td></tr><tr><td>改上一次 commit 内容（加新文件）</td><td><code>git add . &amp;&amp; git commit --amend</code></td></tr><tr><td>撤销上一次 commit（保留改动）</td><td><code>git reset --soft HEAD~1</code></td></tr><tr><td>撤销上一次 commit（不保留改动，危险）</td><td><code>git reset --hard HEAD~1</code></td></tr><tr><td>放弃 merge，回到 merge 之前</td><td><code>git merge --abort</code></td></tr><tr><td>找回误删的分支</td><td><code>git reflog</code> + <code>git checkout &lt;hash&gt;</code></td></tr><tr><td>找回误删的 commit</td><td><code>git reflog</code> + <code>git reset --hard &lt;hash&gt;</code></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id="git-reflog-—-救命神器"><a href="#git-reflog-—-救命神器" class="headerlink" title="git reflog — 救命神器"></a><code>git reflog</code> — 救命神器</h3><p><code>reflog</code> 记录你所有的 HEAD 移动历史。<strong>就算你把分支删了、把 commit 丢了，reflog 里都有记录</strong>。</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git reflog</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">abc1234 (HEAD -&gt; main) HEAD@&#123;0&#125;: commit: feat: add login</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">def5678 HEAD@&#123;1&#125;: checkout: switching from feature to main</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">...</span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>找到想回去的哈希，<code>git reset --hard &lt;hash&gt;</code> 就能回去。</p><hr><h2 id="五、常见问题-FAQ"><a href="#五、常见问题-FAQ" class="headerlink" title="五、常见问题 FAQ"></a>五、常见问题 FAQ</h2><p><strong>Q: <code>.git</code> 目录能不能删？</strong></p><p>A: 能删，但删了之后这个目录就不再是 Git 仓库了，所有历史都没了。别手贱。</p><p><strong>Q: 提交了不该提交的文件怎么办？</strong></p><p>A: 已经推送了就麻烦（要 force push，可能影响别人），没推送的话：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git <span class="built_in">rm</span> --cached &lt;file&gt;    <span class="comment"># 从 Git 移除但保留本地</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ <span class="built_in">echo</span> <span class="string">&quot;&lt;file&gt;&quot;</span> &gt;&gt; .gitignore</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git add .gitignore</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git commit -m <span class="string">&quot;chore: remove file from tracking&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>Q: 怎么把本地仓库推到 GitHub？</strong></p><p>A: GitHub 上新建空仓库，复制 URL，然后：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git remote add origin https://github.com/you/repo.git</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git push -u origin main</span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>Q: main 还是 master？</strong></p><p>A: 2020 年后 GitHub 默认分支改名 <code>main</code>，老项目可能还是 <code>master</code>。两个都行，别纠结。</p><p><strong>Q: Git 和 SVN 啥区别？</strong></p><p>A:SVN 是中央式（一个中心服务器），Git 是分布式（人人都有完整历史）。Git 离线能干活，SVN 不行。</p><hr><h2 id="参考资料"><a href="#参考资料" class="headerlink" title="参考资料"></a>参考资料</h2><ol><li><strong>Pro Git（中文版）</strong> — Git 官方推荐的免费电子书，权威圣经</li></ol><p><a href="https://git-scm.com/book/zh/v2">https://git-scm.com/book/zh/v2</a></p><ol start="2"><li><strong>Git 官方文档（中文）</strong></li></ol><p><a href="https://git-scm.com/docs/gittutorial">https://git-scm.com/docs/gittutorial</a></p><ol start="3"><li><strong>廖雪峰 Git 教程</strong> — 中文圈最经典的入门教程，通俗易懂</li></ol><p><a href="https://liaoxuefeng.com/books/git/">https://liaoxuefeng.com/books/git/</a></p><ol start="4"><li><strong>Learn Git Branching</strong> — 交互式可视化学习分支（强烈推荐）</li></ol><p><a href="https://learngitbranching.js.org/?locale=zh_CN">https://learngitbranching.js.org/?locale=zh_CN</a></p><ol start="5"><li><strong>Conventional Commits</strong> — 提交规范标准</li></ol><p><a href="https://www.conventionalcommits.org/zh-hans/">https://www.conventionalcommits.org/zh-hans/</a></p><ol start="6"><li><strong>图解 Git</strong> — 掘金上的图解系列</li></ol><p><a href="https://juejin.cn/post/7458210657781399606">https://juejin.cn/post/7458210657781399606</a></p><ol start="7"><li><strong>Git 高级合并</strong> — 进阶必读</li></ol><p><a href="https://git-scm.com/book/zh/v2/Git-%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7-%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6.html">https://git-scm.com/book/zh/v2/Git-%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7-%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6.html</a></p><hr><blockquote><p>本教程基于 Pro Git、廖雪峰 Git 教程、Git 官方文档等公开资料整合编写。命令示例均经过实际验证。发现错误请反馈。</p></blockquote>]]></content>
      
      
