      <title>Git 基础与核心操作（上）</title>
      <link href="/2026/07/07/Git%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E4%B8%8E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8A%EF%BC%89/"/>
      <url>/2026/07/07/Git%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E4%B8%8E%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8A%EF%BC%89/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<blockquote><p>写给 Git 新手的入门图文教程。读完就能上手。</p></blockquote><hr><p><img src="https://img.remit.ee/api/file/BQACAgUAAyEGAASHRsPbAAEWwBlqTK4r0Ww9xBc89FuhOugl4yVGqAAC2CEAAkj5YVbPYtfPOhN6jTwE.png" alt="BQACAgUAAyEGAASHRsPbAAEWwBlqTK4r0Ww9xBc89FuhOugl4yVGqAAC2CEAAkj5YVbPYtfPOhN6jTwE.png"></p><h2 id="一、Git-是什么？为什么用？"><a href="#一、Git-是什么？为什么用？" class="headerlink" title="一、Git 是什么？为什么用？"></a>一、Git 是什么？为什么用？</h2><h3 id="一句话解释"><a href="#一句话解释" class="headerlink" title="一句话解释"></a>一句话解释</h3><p>Git 是一个<strong>分布式版本控制系统</strong>——通俗的讲就是”代码的时光机 + 协作记事本”。</p><p>它干两件事：</p><ol><li><p><strong>记录你文件的每一次改动</strong>（谁改的、什么时候改的、改了啥），随时能回滚</p></li><li><p><strong>让多人同时改同一份代码</strong>而不打架</p></li></ol><h3 id="为什么不用”复制文件夹”？"><a href="#为什么不用”复制文件夹”？" class="headerlink" title="为什么不用”复制文件夹”？"></a>为什么不用”复制文件夹”？</h3><p>老办法是 <code>项目_v1</code> → <code>项目_v2</code> → <code>项目_最终版</code> → <code>项目_真的最终版</code>。问题是：</p><ul><li><p>不知道哪一版是哪个</p></li><li><p>多人改同一文件时，谁覆盖谁全靠吼</p></li><li><p>想看历史只能靠记忆</p></li></ul><p>Git 把这些全自动化了。</p><h3 id="Git-vs-GitHub：不是一回事"><a href="#Git-vs-GitHub：不是一回事" class="headerlink" title="Git vs GitHub：不是一回事"></a>Git vs GitHub：不是一回事</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Git</strong>：装在你电脑上的版本控制软件（工具）</p></li><li><p><strong>GitHub &#x2F; Gitee &#x2F; GitLab</strong>：放 Git 仓库的远程服务器（平台）</p></li></ul><p>你可以在完全不用 GitHub 的情况下用 Git；也可以把 Git 仓库放在自己的服务器上。</p><hr><h2 id="二、核心概念：三大工作区"><a href="#二、核心概念：三大工作区" class="headerlink" title="二、核心概念：三大工作区"></a>二、核心概念：三大工作区</h2><p>这是 Git <strong>最核心</strong>的概念，搞懂这一节后面的命令全是顺水推舟。</p><h3 id="三个区域"><a href="#三个区域" class="headerlink" title="三个区域"></a>三个区域</h3><table><thead><tr><th>区域</th><th>英文</th><th>比喻</th><th>存放在哪</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>工作区</strong></td><td>Working Directory</td><td>你的办公桌</td><td>你的项目文件夹</td></tr><tr><td><strong>暂存区</strong></td><td>Staging Area &#x2F; Index</td><td>待提交清单</td><td><code>.git/index</code> 文件</td></tr><tr><td><strong>仓库</strong></td><td>Repository</td><td>公司档案室</td><td><code>.git/</code> 目录</td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id="流转图"><a href="#流转图" class="headerlink" title="流转图"></a>流转图</h3><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">   工作区               暂存区              仓库</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"> (Working Tree)     (Staging Area)     (Repository)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    ┌─────┐           ┌─────┐           ┌─────┐</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    │     │   git add │     │  git commit │     │</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    │ 修改│ ────────► │ 暂存│ ─────────► │ 提交│</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    │     │           │     │            │     │</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    └─────┘           └─────┘           └─────┘</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">                       ▲                   │</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">                       │                   │</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">                       └───── git reset ───┘</span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="文件的三个状态"><a href="#文件的三个状态" class="headerlink" title="文件的三个状态"></a>文件的三个状态</h3><p>对应上面的三个区域，每个文件在 Git 眼里有三种状态：</p><table><thead><tr><th>状态</th><th>英文</th><th>含义</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>已修改</strong></td><td>Modified</td><td>工作区里改了，但还没 <code>git add</code></td></tr><tr><td><strong>已暂存</strong></td><td>Staged</td><td>改了并且 <code>git add</code> 了，等着提交</td></tr><tr><td><strong>已提交</strong></td><td>Committed</td><td>已经在仓库里，安全保存</td></tr><tr><td>任何时候文件只可能处于这三种状态之一。<code>git status</code> 就是告诉你哪些文件处于哪种状态。</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table><hr><h2 id="三、5-分钟上手"><a href="#三、5-分钟上手" class="headerlink" title="三、5 分钟上手"></a>三、5 分钟上手</h2><h3 id="第一步：安装-Git"><a href="#第一步：安装-Git" class="headerlink" title="第一步：安装 Git"></a>第一步：安装 Git</h3><table><thead><tr><th>系统</th><th>命令</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Windows</strong></td><td>下载 <a href="https://git-scm.com/">git-scm.com</a> 安装包，一路 Next</td></tr><tr><td><strong>macOS</strong></td><td><code>brew install git</code> 或装 Xcode Command Line Tools</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ubuntu &#x2F; Debian</strong></td><td><code>sudo apt install git</code></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Arch</strong></td><td><code>sudo pacman -S git</code></td></tr></tbody></table><p>验证安装：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git --version</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">git version 2.39.0</span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="第二步：配置身份（必做，只做一次）"><a href="#第二步：配置身份（必做，只做一次）" class="headerlink" title="第二步：配置身份（必做，只做一次）"></a>第二步：配置身份（必做，只做一次）</h3><p>Git 提交时会记录作者，必须先配好：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git config --global user.name <span class="string">&quot;你的名字&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git config --global user.email <span class="string">&quot;your@email.com&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ul><li><p><code>--global</code> 表示对这台机器上<strong>所有</strong> Git 仓库生效</p></li><li><p>想要<strong>某个仓库</strong>用别的身份，进入那个仓库目录后不加 <code>--global</code> 再跑一遍</p></li></ul><h3 id="第三步：创建第一个仓库"><a href="#第三步：创建第一个仓库" class="headerlink" title="第三步：创建第一个仓库"></a>第三步：创建第一个仓库</h3><p>两种方式：</p><p><strong>方式 A：本地新建</strong></p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ <span class="built_in">mkdir</span> my-project</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ <span class="built_in">cd</span> my-project</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git init</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">Initialized empty Git repository <span class="keyword">in</span> /path/to/my-project/.git/</span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>方式 B：从远程克隆</strong></p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git <span class="built_in">clone</span> https://github.com/someone/some-repo.git</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">Cloning into <span class="string">&#x27;some-repo&#x27;</span>...</span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><code>git init</code> 在当前目录创建一个 <code>.git</code> 隐藏目录，里面存放所有版本信息。这个目录<strong>别手贱删</strong>。</p><h3 id="第四步：第一次提交"><a href="#第四步：第一次提交" class="headerlink" title="第四步：第一次提交"></a>第四步：第一次提交</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ <span class="built_in">echo</span> <span class="string">&quot;Hello Git&quot;</span> &gt; README.md       <span class="comment"># 1. 在工作区创建文件</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git add README.md                   <span class="comment"># 2. 把文件放进暂存区</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git commit -m <span class="string">&quot;first commit&quot;</span>        <span class="comment"># 3. 把暂存区内容提交到仓库</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">[main (root-commit) abc1234] first commit</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"> 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"> create mode 100644 README.md</span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>看到 <code>[main (root-commit) abc1234]</code> 就说明提交成功了。<code>abc1234</code> 是这次提交的哈希值（前 7 位），相当于这次提交的”身份证号”。</p><hr><h2 id="四、基础命令详解"><a href="#四、基础命令详解" class="headerlink" title="四、基础命令详解"></a>四、基础命令详解</h2><h3 id="git-init-—-初始化仓库"><a href="#git-init-—-初始化仓库" class="headerlink" title="git init — 初始化仓库"></a><code>git init</code> — 初始化仓库</h3><p>把当前目录变成 Git 仓库，生成 <code>.git/</code> 目录。</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git init                    <span class="comment"># 当前目录</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git init my-project         <span class="comment"># 新建并进入 my-project 目录</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="git-clone-—-克隆远程仓库"><a href="#git-clone-—-克隆远程仓库" class="headerlink" title="git clone &lt;url&gt; — 克隆远程仓库"></a><code>git clone &lt;url&gt;</code> — 克隆远程仓库</h3><p>把远程仓库完整下载到本地，包括所有历史记录。</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git <span class="built_in">clone</span> https://github.com/user/repo.git</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git <span class="built_in">clone</span> https://github.com/user/repo.git my-folder  <span class="comment"># 克隆到指定目录</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="git-add-—-添加到暂存区"><a href="#git-add-—-添加到暂存区" class="headerlink" title="git add — 添加到暂存区"></a><code>git add</code> — 添加到暂存区</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git add file.txt            <span class="comment"># 添加指定文件</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git add file1.txt file2.txt <span class="comment"># 添加多个文件</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git add .                   <span class="comment"># 添加当前目录所有变化</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git add -A                  <span class="comment"># 添加所有变化（包括删除）</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git add -p                  <span class="comment"># 交互式添加（块级别）</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>小坑</strong>：<code>git add .</code> 不会添加被 <code>.gitignore</code> 忽略的文件。</p><h3 id="git-commit-—-提交到仓库"><a href="#git-commit-—-提交到仓库" class="headerlink" title="git commit — 提交到仓库"></a><code>git commit</code> — 提交到仓库</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git commit -m <span class="string">&quot;提交说明&quot;</span>     <span class="comment"># 提交暂存区的所有内容</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git commit -am <span class="string">&quot;说明&quot;</span>        <span class="comment"># 自动 add 已跟踪的文件 + commit（不会 add 新文件）</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git commit --amend          <span class="comment"># 修改上一次提交</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>写好 commit message 是基本素养</strong>：</p><ul><li><p>第一行 ≤ 50 字，概括这次干了啥</p></li><li><p>空一行</p></li><li><p>详细说明（可选）</p></li><li><p>祈使句：”add feature” 而不是 “added feature” 或 “adds feature”</p></li></ul><p>好的：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">feat: add user login API</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">好的：feat: add user login API</span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>坏的：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">fixed bug</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">update code</span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="git-status-—-查看状态"><a href="#git-status-—-查看状态" class="headerlink" title="git status — 查看状态"></a><code>git status</code> — 查看状态</h3><p>这是<strong>最常用的命令</strong>，拿不准时先跑它：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git status</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">On branch main</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">Your branch is up to <span class="built_in">date</span> with <span class="string">&#x27;origin/main&#x27;</span>.</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">  </span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">Changes to be committed:</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">  (use <span class="string">&quot;git restore --staged &lt;file&gt;...&quot;</span> to unstage)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">        modified:   README.md</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">  </span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">Changes not staged <span class="keyword">for</span> commit:</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">  (use <span class="string">&quot;git add &lt;file&gt;...&quot;</span> to update what will be committed)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">        modified:   src/main.js</span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>输出会告诉你：哪些文件已暂存、哪些没暂存、哪些未跟踪。</p><h3 id="git-log-—-查看历史"><a href="#git-log-—-查看历史" class="headerlink" title="git log — 查看历史"></a><code>git log</code> — 查看历史</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git <span class="built_in">log</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">commit abc1234567890... (HEAD -&gt; main)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">Author: 张大虾 &lt;zhang@email.com&gt;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">Date:   Mon Jul 7 10:23:45 2026 +0800</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">  </span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    first commit</span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>常用选项：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git <span class="built_in">log</span> --oneline           <span class="comment"># 一行显示</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git <span class="built_in">log</span> --graph             <span class="comment"># 图形化显示分支</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git <span class="built_in">log</span> --all --oneline --graph  <span class="comment"># 图形化显示所有分支</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git <span class="built_in">log</span> -p                  <span class="comment"># 显示具体改动</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git <span class="built_in">log</span> --author=<span class="string">&quot;张大虾&quot;</span>   <span class="comment"># 按作者过滤</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="git-diff-—-查看差异"><a href="#git-diff-—-查看差异" class="headerlink" title="git diff — 查看差异"></a><code>git diff</code> — 查看差异</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git diff                    <span class="comment"># 工作区 vs 暂存区</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git diff --staged           <span class="comment"># 暂存区 vs 上次提交</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git diff HEAD               <span class="comment"># 工作区 vs 上次提交</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git diff branch-a branch-b  <span class="comment"># 两个分支的差异</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="git-rm-git-mv"><a href="#git-rm-git-mv" class="headerlink" title="git rm &#x2F; git mv"></a><code>git rm</code> &#x2F; <code>git mv</code></h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git <span class="built_in">rm</span> file.txt             <span class="comment"># 删除文件（同时从暂存区移除）</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git <span class="built_in">mv</span> old.txt new.txt      <span class="comment"># 重命名文件（等价于 mv + git add + git rm）</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="五、远程协作"><a href="#五、远程协作" class="headerlink" title="五、远程协作"></a>五、远程协作</h2><p>远程仓库 &#x3D; 放在服务器上的 Git 仓库（GitHub &#x2F; Gitee &#x2F; GitLab &#x2F; 自己服务器）。</p><h3 id="git-remote-—-管理远程仓库"><a href="#git-remote-—-管理远程仓库" class="headerlink" title="git remote — 管理远程仓库"></a><code>git remote</code> — 管理远程仓库</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git remote -v                                    <span class="comment"># 查看远程仓库</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git remote add origin &lt;url&gt;                      <span class="comment"># 添加远程仓库</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git remote remove origin                         <span class="comment"># 删除远程仓库</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git remote rename origin upstream                <span class="comment"># 重命名</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><code>origin</code> 是远程仓库的默认名字（约定俗成），可以改成别的，但一般没人改。</p><h3 id="git-push-—-推送到远程"><a href="#git-push-—-推送到远程" class="headerlink" title="git push — 推送到远程"></a><code>git push</code> — 推送到远程</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git push                       <span class="comment"># 推送到默认远程 + 默认分支</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git push origin main           <span class="comment"># 推送到 origin 的 main 分支</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git push -u origin main        <span class="comment"># 第一次推送，加 -u 关联上游</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git push --force               <span class="comment"># 强制推送（慎用！会覆盖远程历史）</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git push --force-with-lease    <span class="comment"># 强制推送的安全版（推荐）</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>**第一次推送要加 <code>-u</code>**：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git push -u origin main</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">Enumerating objects: 3, <span class="keyword">done</span>.</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">Counting objects: 100% (3/3), <span class="keyword">done</span>.</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">Writing objects: 100% (3/3), 215 bytes | 215.00 KiB/s, <span class="keyword">done</span>.</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">Total 3 (delta 0), reused 0 (delta 0), pack-reused 0</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">To https://github.com/user/repo.git</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"> * [new branch]      main -&gt; main</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">Branch <span class="string">&#x27;main&#x27;</span> <span class="built_in">set</span> up to track remote branch <span class="string">&#x27;main&#x27;</span> from <span class="string">&#x27;origin&#x27;</span>.</span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><code>-u</code> 关联之后，以后直接 <code>git push</code> 就够了。</p><h3 id="git-pull-—-拉取远程更新"><a href="#git-pull-—-拉取远程更新" class="headerlink" title="git pull — 拉取远程更新"></a><code>git pull</code> — 拉取远程更新</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git pull                      <span class="comment"># 拉取 + 自动合并</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git pull --rebase             <span class="comment"># 拉取 + 变基（更干净的历史）</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><code>git pull</code> 其实是两步：<code>git fetch</code> + <code>git merge</code>。</p><h3 id="git-fetch-—-仅下载不合并"><a href="#git-fetch-—-仅下载不合并" class="headerlink" title="git fetch — 仅下载不合并"></a><code>git fetch</code> — 仅下载不合并</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git fetch origin              <span class="comment"># 下载远程更新，不动本地</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">$ git fetch --all               <span class="comment"># 下载所有远程的更新</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>什么时候用 fetch 而不是 pull？</p><ul><li><p>想先看看远程有什么新东西再决定合不合并</p></li><li><p>多远程协作时（origin + upstream 都有更新）</p></li></ul><hr><h2 id="参考资料"><a href="#参考资料" class="headerlink" title="参考资料"></a>参考资料</h2><ol><li><strong>Pro Git（中文版）</strong> — Git 官方推荐的免费电子书，权威圣经</li></ol><p><a href="https://git-scm.com/book/zh/v2">https://git-scm.com/book/zh/v2</a></p><ol start="2"><li><strong>Git 官方文档（中文）</strong></li></ol><p><a href="https://git-scm.com/docs/gittutorial">https://git-scm.com/docs/gittutorial</a></p><ol start="3"><li><strong>廖雪峰 Git 教程</strong> — 中文圈最经典的入门教程，通俗易懂</li></ol><p><a href="https://liaoxuefeng.com/books/git/">https://liaoxuefeng.com/books/git/</a></p><ol start="4"><li><strong>Learn Git Branching</strong> — 交互式可视化学习分支（强烈推荐）</li></ol><p><a href="https://learngitbranching.js.org/?locale=zh_CN">https://learngitbranching.js.org/?locale=zh_CN</a></p><ol start="5"><li><strong>Conventional Commits</strong> — 提交规范标准</li></ol><p><a href="https://www.conventionalcommits.org/zh-hans/">https://www.conventionalcommits.org/zh-hans/</a></p><ol start="6"><li><strong>图解 Git</strong> — 掘金上的图解系列</li></ol><p><a href="https://juejin.cn/post/7458210657781399606">https://juejin.cn/post/7458210657781399606</a></p><ol start="7"><li><strong>Git 高级合并</strong> — 进阶必读</li></ol><p><a href="https://git-scm.com/book/zh/v2/Git-%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7-%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6.html">https://git-scm.com/book/zh/v2/Git-%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7-%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6.html</a></p><hr><blockquote><p>本教程基于 Pro Git、廖雪峰 Git 教程、Git 官方文档等公开资料整合编写。命令示例均经过实际验证。发现错误请反馈。</p></blockquote>]]></content>
      
      
